<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_3_-_0_1_-_1_8_1_0_-_a_d_d_-_t_e_m_p_o_r_a_l_-_d_i_m_e_n_s_i_o_n.behavior_patch.depa-ontology apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "depa-ontology" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-c5324e1577" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-c5324e1577 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGT>
        系统 SHALL 在 `OmValueType` 中新增 `&apos;Validity&apos;` 类型，用于声明具有时间语义的属性。`defineAttribute` SHALL 支持 `value_type: &apos;Validity&apos;`。`om_attr_def` 关系 SHALL 能存储该类型。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGT>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-c5324e1577-suite { name = "Temporal 属性类型支持" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-c5324e1577-c-9d809f279c { name = "定义 Validity 类型属性" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGV>
                已定义类型 `Employee`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGV>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGW>
                调用 `defineAttribute(runner, &apos;Employee&apos;, &apos;valid_from&apos;, &apos;Validity&apos;, true)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGW>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGX>
                属性定义成功，`om_attr_def` 中记录 `value_type = &apos;Validity&apos;`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGX>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-c5324e1577-c-9fed0ae753 { name = "设置 Validity 类型属性值" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGY>
                `Employee` 有 `valid_from: Validity` 属性
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGY>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGZ>
                调用 `setProperty(runner, entityId, &apos;valid_from&apos;, &apos;2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBGZ>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH0>
                属性值被写入，CozoDB 将其存储为 Validity 类型
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH0>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-e3582191f3" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-e3582191f3 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH1>
        系统 SHALL 将 `om_property` 关系改造为 bi-temporal 结构：`om_property { entity_id, attr_name, valid_time: Validity =&gt; value, tx_time: String }`。`valid_time` 为业务生效时间（使用 CozoDB Validity 作为最后一个 key 列），`tx_time` 为系统记录时间（ISO-8601 字符串）。每次属性写入 SHALL 产生一条新的时间版本记录。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH1>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-e3582191f3-suite { name = "Bi-temporal 属性历史（om_property 改造）" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-e3582191f3-c-1750478c50 { name = "写入属性自动记录时间版本" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH2>
                已定义类型 `Employee` 及属性 `department`(String)；实体 `emp1` 的 `department` 当前值为 `&apos;Engineering&apos;`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH2>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH3>
                调用 `setProperty(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;department&apos;, &apos;Product&apos;, { validTime: &apos;2026-06-01T00:00:00Z&apos; })`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH3>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH4>
                `om_property` 中新增一条记录：`entity_id=&apos;emp1&apos;, attr_name=&apos;department&apos;, valid_time=&apos;2026-06-01&apos;, value=&apos;Product&apos;, tx_time=&lt;当前系统时间&gt;`；之前的 `&apos;Engineering&apos;` 记录仍然保留
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH4>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-e3582191f3-c-709fe28aeb { name = "不指定 validTime 时使用当前时间" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH5>
                已定义类型 `Employee` 及属性 `name`(String)
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH5>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH6>
                调用 `setProperty(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;name&apos;, &apos;Alice&apos;)` 不传 validTime
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH6>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH7>
                系统使用当前时间作为 `valid_time` 和 `tx_time`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH7>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-e3582191f3-c-929540a749 { name = "读取属性默认返回最新有效值" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH8>
                `emp1` 的 `department` 有两条历史记录：`Engineering@2026-01` 和 `Product@2026-06`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH8>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH9>
                调用 `getProperty(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;department&apos;)`（不指定时间）
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBH9>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHA>
                返回最新有效值 `&apos;Product&apos;`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHA>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-8f4cbddd2e" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-8f4cbddd2e (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHB>
        系统 SHALL 提供 `getPropertyHistory(runner, entityId, attrName, options?)` API，返回指定属性的所有时间版本记录，按 `valid_time` 排序。`options` 可选参数包括 `{ from?: string, to?: string }` 用于时间范围过滤。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHB>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-8f4cbddd2e-suite { name = "属性历史查询" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-8f4cbddd2e-c-209f5e2a0d { name = "查询属性完整历史" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHC>
                `emp1` 的 `department` 有三条历史记录
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHC>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHD>
                调用 `getPropertyHistory(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;department&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHD>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHE>
                返回数组，每条包含 `{ value, valid_time, tx_time }`，按 valid_time 升序排列
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHE>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-8f4cbddd2e-c-5c18fbe678 { name = "按时间范围过滤历史" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHF>
                `emp1` 的 `department` 有 2025-01、2025-06、2026-01 三条记录
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHF>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHG>
                调用 `getPropertyHistory(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;department&apos;, { from: &apos;2025-05&apos;, to: &apos;2025-12&apos; })`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHG>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHH>
                仅返回 2025-06 的记录
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHH>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-be76ba799b" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-be76ba799b (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHJ>
        系统 SHALL 提供 `getPropertyAsOf(runner, entityId, attrName, timestamp)` API，利用 CozoDB 的 `@ timestamp` 语法返回指定时间点的属性值。系统 SHALL 提供 `getEntityViewAsOf(runner, entityId, timestamp)` API，返回实体在指定时间点的完整快照（所有属性的当时值）。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHJ>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-be76ba799b-suite { name = "时间点快照查询（As-Of Query）" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-be76ba799b-c-4ebf311af5 { name = "查询历史时间点的属性值" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHK>
                `emp1` 的 `department` 在 2025-01 为 `Engineering`，2026-01 变更为 `Product`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHK>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHM>
                调用 `getPropertyAsOf(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;department&apos;, &apos;2025-06-01T00:00:00Z&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHM>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHN>
                返回 `&apos;Engineering&apos;`（2025-06 时的有效值）
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHN>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-be76ba799b-c-58cc37e783 { name = "查询实体完整快照" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHP>
                `emp1` 在 2025-06 时有 `name=&apos;Alice&apos;`, `department=&apos;Engineering&apos;`, `role=&apos;IC&apos;`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHP>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHQ>
                调用 `getEntityViewAsOf(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;2025-06-01T00:00:00Z&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHQ>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHR>
                返回包含所有属性在该时间点有效值的完整视图
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHR>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-be76ba799b-c-bf2650ce9c { name = "查询未来时间点返回最新已知值" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHS>
                `emp1` 最新记录为 2026-01
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHS>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHT>
                调用 `getPropertyAsOf(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;department&apos;, &apos;2030-01-01T00:00:00Z&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHT>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHV>
                返回 2026-01 的值（CozoDB Validity 的 as-of 语义）
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHV>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-7cb8f3178a" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-7cb8f3178a (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHW>
        系统 SHALL 将 `om_edge` 关系改造为支持有效期：`om_edge { from_id, rel_name, to_id, valid_time: Validity =&gt; props, tx_time: String }`。`linkEntities` SHALL 接受可选的 `validTime` 参数。系统 SHALL 提供 `getNeighborsAsOf(runner, entityId, relName, timestamp)` 查询指定时间点的关系。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHW>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-7cb8f3178a-suite { name = "Temporal 关系（边的有效期）" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-7cb8f3178a-c-26324bf676 { name = "创建带有效期的关系" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHX>
                已定义关系 `belongs_to`（Employee → Department）
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHX>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHY>
                调用 `linkEntities(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;belongs_to&apos;, &apos;dept-eng&apos;, { validTime: &apos;2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&apos; })`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHY>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHZ>
                `om_edge` 中记录该关系及其 valid_time
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBHZ>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-7cb8f3178a-c-aef1129139 { name = "查询某时间点的关系" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ0>
                `emp1` 在 2025-01 属于 `dept-eng`，2026-01 转到 `dept-product`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ0>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ1>
                调用 `getNeighborsAsOf(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;belongs_to&apos;, &apos;2025-06-01T00:00:00Z&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ1>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ2>
                返回 `dept-eng`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ2>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-7cb8f3178a-c-709fe28aeb { name = "不指定 validTime 时使用当前时间" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ3>
                已定义关系 `belongs_to`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ3>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ4>
                调用 `linkEntities(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;belongs_to&apos;, &apos;dept-eng&apos;)` 不传 validTime
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ4>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ5>
                系统使用当前时间作为 valid_time
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ5>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-e99518acbf" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-e99518acbf (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ6>
        系统 SHALL 提供 `getEdgeHistory(runner, fromId, relName, toId?, options?)` API，返回指定关系的所有时间版本。当 `toId` 省略时返回该实体在该关系上的所有历史邻居。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ6>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-e99518acbf-suite { name = "关系历史查询" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-e99518acbf-c-97baac31e2 { name = "查询关系完整历史" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ7>
                `emp1` 的 `belongs_to` 关系有多条历史记录（不同部门）
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ7>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ8>
                调用 `getEdgeHistory(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;belongs_to&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ8>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ9>
                返回所有历史关系记录，按 valid_time 排序
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJ9>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-e99518acbf-c-b3075f9005 { name = "查询特定关系对的历史" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJA>
                `emp1` 与 `dept-eng` 的 `belongs_to` 关系有多次变更
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJA>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJB>
                调用 `getEdgeHistory(runner, &apos;emp1&apos;, &apos;belongs_to&apos;, &apos;dept-eng&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJB>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJC>
                仅返回 emp1→dept-eng 的历史记录
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJC>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-5a200f2127" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-5a200f2127 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJD>
        系统 SHALL 确保 Action/Mutation/Constraint 与 temporal 属性协同工作。ActionContext 中的 `getProperty` 和 `setProperty` SHALL 支持 temporal 参数。约束校验 SHALL 基于当前有效值（latest）执行。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJD>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-5a200f2127-suite { name = "Temporal 与行为层集成" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-5a200f2127-c-c42599ba83 { name = "Action 中使用 temporal setProperty" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJE>
                Action `transfer` 的 handler 调用 `ctx.setProperty(&apos;department&apos;, &apos;Product&apos;, { validTime: futureDate })`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJE>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJF>
                执行该 Action
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJF>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJG>
                属性以指定的 validTime 写入 om_property
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJG>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-5a200f2127-c-00b6aa22e9 { name = "约束基于最新有效值校验" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJH>
                条件约束：当 `status=&apos;active&apos;` 时 `end_date` 必须为空；实体最新有效 `status` 为 `&apos;active&apos;`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJH>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJJ>
                调用 `setProperty(runner, entityId, &apos;end_date&apos;, &apos;2026-12-31&apos;)`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJJ>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJK>
                约束校验基于最新有效的 `status` 值触发，抛出违反错误
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJK>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://depa-ontology/requirements/add-temporal-dimension-r-47b1a118d5" } (
      <Requirement #add-temporal-dimension-r-47b1a118d5 (
        <Statement ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJM>
        系统 SHALL 在 `initSchema` 中自动检测并迁移旧版 `om_property`（无 valid_time/tx_time）和 `om_edge`（无 valid_time/tx_time）到新的 bi-temporal 结构。迁移时旧数据的 valid_time 和 tx_time SHALL 使用迁移执行时的当前时间。
        </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJM>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #add-temporal-dimension-r-47b1a118d5-suite { name = "Schema 迁移兼容" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-47b1a118d5-c-a820232bc7 { name = "旧 schema 自动迁移" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJN>
                数据库中存在旧版 `om_property { entity_id, attr_name =&gt; value }`
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJN>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJP>
                调用 `initSchema(runner)` 使用新版代码
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJP>
                <Then ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJQ>
                系统检测到旧 schema，将数据迁移到新结构，旧数据获得当前时间作为 valid_time 和 tx_time；迁移后所有现有 API 正常工作
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJQ>
              )>
              <Case #add-temporal-dimension-r-47b1a118d5-c-7ce3d7551c { name = "新 schema 无需迁移" } (
                <Given ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJR>
                数据库中已是新版 bi-temporal schema
                </?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJR>
                <When ?01M1W0XR64QR85H6405SJKYBJS>
                调用 `initSchema(runner)`
